{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40112","headline":"客舍寓怀 · 钱珝","name":"客舍寓怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洒洒滩声晚霁时，客亭风袖半披垂。\n野云行止谁相待，明月襟怀祗自知。\n无伴偶吟溪上路，有花偷笑腊前枝。\n牵情景物潜惆怅，忽似伤春远别离。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱珝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}